# Build context of the gateway image (docker/gateway/Dockerfile, context = repository root).
# Whitelist: exclude everything, then re-include only what the image build needs. This keeps
# local build directories, .git and the simulator out of the context. The simulator image
# uses its own context (simulator/) and simulator/.dockerignore.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!cmake
!gateway
!configs/gateway.example.yaml
# Not needed: the image is built with GATEWAY_BUILD_TESTS=OFF.
gateway/tests
